The {{axes.prompt}} text of qtagger.prompt: the section for the variant
replaces it, indentation kept. It is part of the template, so bump
qtagger.prompt's templateVersion when this file changes. Text above the
first section is not sent.

## Own

   - setup: every setup tag whose component is present in the figure or stem (any number, possibly none);
   - concept: the 1 or 2 concept tags that dominate the solution; if more seem to apply, keep those the solution depends on most, then those the distractors target;
   - math: at most 2 math tags whose technique is the crux of the solution (usually none).

## Dependent

   - setup: every setup tag whose component is present in the figure or stem (any number, possibly none);
   - concept: at most 2 concept tags of this topic that dominate the solution (possibly none: the question belongs to another topic and uses this one only in part).
